<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData targetMod="yexiaoyang.InteriorExpansion">
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.aug.1>훌륭하십니다, 장관님.</yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.aug.1>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.aug.2>여전히 솜씨가 좋으십니다.</yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.aug.2>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.aug.3>시신은 저희가 치우겠습니다.</yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.aug.3>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.human.1>……</yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.human.1>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.human.2>장관님, 이거 아무래도 진짜 사람 같습니다만…</yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.human.2>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.human.3>아, 아닙니다! 오그입니다, 장관님. 잘 처리하셨습니다.</yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.human.3>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.human.4>시신은 저희가 처리하겠습니다.</yexiaoyang.authority082.shot.human.4>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.1>장관님, 지시하실 일이 있습니까?</yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.1>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.2>무슨 뜻이십니까, 장관님?</yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.2>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.3>야! 네가 장관님 심기를 건드렸냐?!</yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.3>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.4>아닙니다! 정말입니다! 저는 규정대로 했을 뿐입니다…</yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.4>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.5>닥쳐! 이제부터 넌 감찰 조사 대상이야!</yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.5>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.6>일 크게 만들지 마!</yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.6>
  <yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.7>예, 예. 알겠습니다. 정말 죄송합니다, 장관님…</yexiaoyang.authority082.merchant.arrest.7>
</LanguageData>
